1. The `position.set("gyro", ByteBufUtil.hexDump(buf.readSlice(6)));` line was added to handle the 0x0C case.
2. The `position.setAltitude(buf.readShort());` line was added to handle the 0x02 case.
3. The `default` case was added to skip over any unknown data blocks.

